{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27418","headline":"送李相公昭义平复起彼宣慰员外副行 · 顾非熊","name":"送李相公昭义平复起彼宣慰员外副行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天井虽收寇未平，所司促战急王程。\n晓驰云骑穿花去，夜与星郎带月行。\n新咏尽题关外事，故乡因过洛阳城。\n时逢寒食游人识，竟说从来有大名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}